{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>מורשה</b> — twice in the Masorah: this one and the other מורשה קהלת יעקב. Through the merit of Torah they inherited the Land, as written: 'and He gave them the lands of nations… because they kept His statutes and observed His teachings' (Ps. 105:44–45). And it is written מורשה and not written ירושה — a hint that they cause others to inherit (מורישים) and do not inherit (יורשים), that they would not enter the Land."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:04.299764773Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}